    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prime minister has been kidnapped by the evil intergalactic war crimes tribunal! Your mission is simple: extract the prime minister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this gloriously generic euro-schmup you shoot at things and dodge the things that are shooting at you. Earn spacecoin and upgrade your ship. It doesn't get much better than that!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some enemies in Quiberon Zeta:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Angled Cruiser</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These Delpherian Angled Cruisers picked the wrong day to commute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486090/extras/df25aaaea5f61827a046d2dd7c3f4390.webp?t=1750542982\" width=32 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medical Ship</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intergalactic law prohibits attacking medical ships, but when has that stopped us?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486090/extras/669cf113dc3c1f3c1bf9d5a5f51379fd.avif?t=1750542982\" width=80 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liberator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basic Terran attack ship. Shoots a laser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486090/extras/6eed3bd618446765fd70d34da9020b05.avif?t=1750542982\" width=75 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class A Flangulator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This ship is good at two things: chewing bubble gum, and flangulating. And she's all out of bubble gum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486090/extras/17075a39b0914447baa49355e495a797.avif?t=1750542982\" width=134 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nexus</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pride of the Mirak'Gul, this ship has a powerful secret weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486090/extras/34d8b6bc1bb7e005c268099ff1a1755e.avif?t=1750542982\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prime minister has been kidnapped by the evil intergalactic war crimes tribunal! Your mission is simple: extract the prime minister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this gloriously generic euro-schmup you shoot at things and dodge the things that are shooting at you. Earn spacecoin and upgrade your ship. It doesn't get much better than that!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some enemies in Quiberon Zeta:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Angled Cruiser</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These Delpherian Angled Cruisers picked the wrong day to commute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486090/extras/df25aaaea5f61827a046d2dd7c3f4390.webp?t=1750542982\" width=32 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medical Ship</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intergalactic law prohibits attacking medical ships, but when has that stopped us?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486090/extras/669cf113dc3c1f3c1bf9d5a5f51379fd.avif?t=1750542982\" width=80 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liberator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basic Terran attack ship. Shoots a laser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486090/extras/6eed3bd618446765fd70d34da9020b05.avif?t=1750542982\" width=75 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class A Flangulator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This ship is good at two things: chewing bubble gum, and flangulating. And she's all out of bubble gum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486090/extras/17075a39b0914447baa49355e495a797.avif?t=1750542982\" width=134 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nexus</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pride of the Mirak'Gul, this ship has a powerful secret weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486090/extras/34d8b6bc1bb7e005c268099ff1a1755e.avif?t=1750542982\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
